      "writtenOn": "2025-03-12T15:50:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yeah, I did it this way as SingleTypeAllocator does not directly know the used sizes. Although it would be better if they were tracked together. Maybe cwallez@ or lokokung@ have better ideas here.",
      "parentUuid": "7aeae022_98789cf0",
      "revId": "de05316fb20a721193d108136f4352e2d95f9d25",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
