      "message": "This is what you meant for sub-allocations right? ResourceMemoryAllocator::Tick() runs when the memory is available for reuse so you could subtract from mTotalUsedMemory there. Although I think you can say the memory no longer counts as used here when Deallocate() is called. The memory could be handed back out if there were appropriate barriers it\u0027s just not.",
