      "side": 1,
      "message": "These would need to be \"white box\" tests since they would poke the internals of a backend. https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/dawn/src/dawn/tests/white_box/;l\u003d1?q\u003df:dawn%20white\u0026sq\u003d\n\nBut also this is the kind of thing that\u0027s very hard to test because it will depent on the driver, etc. For a long time I\u0027ve thought we should review how the memory allocation works across all the backends and see if we can move more logic to a frontend class that could be better tested. I guess we\u0027ll see when we add support for MTLHeap.",
